{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d63addc79143fd9b6e155d9cab49ee954834a5cfdfa2cc3e09d2134f57de4dd2", "ja": "（歩に誘われて、ハイキングに来た。リフトに乗ると\nいうが……歩は高いところが苦手だったような？）", "zh": "（受步邀请来爬山。她说要坐缆车，可是……步好像不太擅长待在高处？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f6bd6c753a9abb069b13a59f5cd91bb3092c2d30e71baf457860e1c7d1225857", "ja": "はぁ～、怖かった。\n何度乗っても、慣れないなぁ……。", "zh": "唉～，吓死我了。\n不管坐多少次，还是适应不了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a35d6dbb121af096ee4dabdfddbd7b3ffefa66fe3a2656bc943e990b813b1926", "ja": "そうだな。風で揺れるし、足元も不安定だ。\nでも、思ったよりは平気そうで安心したよ。", "zh": "是啊，被风吹得摇摇晃晃的，脚下也不稳。\n不过，看起来比想象中要镇定，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "25d4802b3abe039b05220b43e1ee10e16f61ee4d2cbd82568490e31b72320a44", "ja": "それは……{$P$}が\n一緒だったからじゃないかな。", "zh": "那是因为……有{$P$}陪着我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8eacb4cdee4638ec1df61cc36ea45061f04edaf1338f4326f0e234adb8a247ff", "ja": "前は一人だったから、パニック寸前って感じでさ。\n隣に誰かいるのっていいね！　安心感が全然違う！", "zh": "之前是一个人，所以感觉都快要慌到不行了。  \n身边有个人真好啊！安心感完全不一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1005_p", "source_sha256": "98b9ed9fee5eed706483133c3cec1a9baf5e784e17389bfc9f45f228115fc087", "ja": "一緒にリフトに乗っただけなんだけど……\nそんなにか？", "zh": "明明只是一起坐了趟缆车……有那么明显吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "09785e8712e434bd591b0bce4e40957ff769cf48281265c6d8ea0e5c64343ad3", "ja": "そんなにだよ！　{$P$}と話してたら\n怖いってことも、少し忘れられたし。", "zh": "就是那么严重啦！和{$P$}聊天的时候，连害怕这件事都能暂时忘掉一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "00559c1952d1e1c9c754c9940fae30bbc5992d58d25d29514438e3c59fc10f30", "ja": "あと、下を見ないようにって意識しちゃうんだけど、\nそれもあんまりなかったかなって……あっ。", "zh": "而且，本来总会下意识地告诉自己不要往下看，\n但刚才也没怎么多想呢……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4e9ebfabe23cdd5b20f2d8753bfef52035e2646b716f7a682c5b99e2d9d9c25c", "ja": "ん、どうした？", "zh": "嗯，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cc230e9ebc101586e2c5af6eb40bd5566e1a1b1f3afb22afcb9777ca1d298d90", "ja": "あ、あのさ。リフトに乗ってる間……\n{$P$}にいっぱい迷惑かけたよね。", "zh": "啊，那个……坐缆车的时候……\n给{$P$}添了很多麻烦吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "13eb21dec2cdb684c438bc8e5a76be60dee57f12a616c26dbf43df6e28eb5f9e", "ja": "ゴ、ゴメンね！　誘ったのはアタシなのに……。\n景色とか、ゆっくり見れなかったよね？", "zh": "对、对不起！明明是我邀请你来的……。\n风景之类的，也没能好好欣赏吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5e670005a05c4a9572163fbcd618e3f3dd3a25f64ef8adcd09f97a7b32caec34", "ja": "そんなことないよ。迷惑だと思ってないし、\nむしろ、誘ってくれてありがとうな。", "zh": "没那回事。我一点也没觉得麻烦，\n反而要谢谢你邀请我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cd0fc15aa12fd58e3eff2c1a9c7825fb821aa4d4306a7a6c3d82168bb803bdea", "ja": "えっ？　で、でも……。", "zh": "诶？可、可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1013_p", "source_sha256": "674c32051b233973d31f880f0a808ed3824429187b55f317345a7477bc91f891", "ja": "リフトに乗るって聞いた時は心配したけど……。\n歩の成長を見られた気がして、嬉しかったよ。", "zh": "听说你要乘坐升降台的时候，我还挺担心的……  \n不过，能看到步的成长，我真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4bdc917fe3c1b658adb244d7d5653d7a342f5999ffc0149e0b29f19d2279406b", "ja": "成長……？　自分じゃよくわかんないけど。\n{$P$}がそう言うなら、そうかも？", "zh": "成长……？我自己倒是不太清楚。\n要是{$P$}这么说，那也许是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1015_p", "source_sha256": "261b8cd274841e91b3081ec4a9b19d49145e1c4ddb560992aa0ba24fe1b8c91a", "ja": "ははっ、そうなんだよ。それより、歩！\n山頂の景色が最高だって言ってたけど……ここか？", "zh": "哈哈，没错，就是这样。比起这个，步！\n你之前说山顶的景色棒极了……就是这里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c0facd69a1892e277e660e5fc51eaa51b62540cf2b2ea63b55ef9d3ef8f7d720", "ja": "そうそう！　リフトからの景色もいいけど、\nアタシのオススメはやっぱり、てっぺんからの景色！", "zh": "对对！虽然从缆车上看到的景色也很棒，但我最推荐的果然还是从山顶眺望的景色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "95873e929e6724db01f4bf6d538c1bf358c5b263987ac3d4c015fdad95aeca5a", "ja": "あ、でもその前に、売店寄っていい？\nすっごく美味しいソフトクリームがあるんだ～♪", "zh": "啊，不过在那之前，可以先去趟小卖部吗？\n那里有超好吃的软冰淇淋～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8e4fbc8800e2d59be4e4422b43b1029fb4d09c9395769cb95214282f12f2dbf7", "ja": "もちろん。今日は歩に付いてくって決めたからな。\nどこまでもお供するよ。", "zh": "当然。今天我已经决定跟着阿步了。\n无论你要去哪里，我都会奉陪到底。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0454_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "235ef0ea2029439aa5cbd4753a3312dbb0593f9143188f9d8add6a9ecbbf75d6", "ja": "うん。今日はアタシに任せてよ！\n最高の時間にするから、楽しみにしてて♪", "zh": "嗯。今天就交给我吧！\n一定会让你度过最棒的时光，好好期待吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
